  "details": "When I load into VR a good 80% of my uploaded avatars thumbnails have \"No Image Found\" and when I trying loading into them it sends me into the error bot. This isn't just my own avatars but when I try loading other player's avatars as well. Images of groups, profile icons, avatar pedestals, ect all show \"No Image Found\" there is a rare chance I do see the image BUT it was most commonly friend pictures or avatars. \n\nIve cleared all my Cached Data, restarting the game, restarting my PC, Fully uninstalling the game, uninstalling restarting my pc then reinstalling.\n\nThis was happening before the very most recent update and had to double check if this update fixed it but it didn't",
